 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Screen saver: 70 old names cut to 7 archetypes plus 17 survivors; dropped single-product commercial packs and dead novelty savers (Aqua 3D, AquaReal, Bird Life, Briblo, CodeSaver, Don't Touch My Computer, League Displays, Lifeglobe Goldfish, MSN Fireplace, Max Taylor Panoramas, Seraline, Western Railway 3D, zz DVD and similar). XScreenSaver stays the kind source. Reference CD-ROM: 12 old names regrouped into five archetypes (Encarta, Bookshelf, Compton's, Grolier, Britannica) plus six; World Book and Merriam-Webster discs stay as m with no verified facts. Home publishing: The Print Shop, PrintMaster and Print Artist archetypes; Print Explosion stays flat (Nova Development not on a retrieved page). P2P: 60 old names reduced to 8 archetypes plus 12 historic icons; dropped research and anonymity-network components (GNUnet, Freenet FProxy kept only as icon, Frost, Nodezilla, XNap, giFT), and tiny clones. Entertainment titles are not listed, per the rules."
}